#Data Arrangement:
#For the 4x4 tables, each starting pair needs its own table.
#This is the AA table:  
#			5' --> 3'      
#			    AX
#			    UY
#			3' <-- 5'   
#			    Y->          
#	   	---------------------------- 
#	(X) 	A	C	G	U  
#	 | 	----------------------------
#	 V   
#	(A) 	0.7	0.7	0.7	0.7
#	(C) 	0.7	0.7	0.7	0.7
#	(G) 	-0.4	0.7	0.0	0.7
#	(U) 	0.7	0.7	0.7	0.4

#An energy of "." is "infinity," i.e. not allowed.





#		5' --> 3'
		   AX
		   1Y
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	1    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.9	0.9	0.9	0.9
C	0.9	0.9	0.9	0.9
G	-0.2	0.9	0.2	0.9
1	0.9	0.9	0.9	-0.3


#		5' --> 3'
		   CX
		   GY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	1    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.0	0.0	-0.5	0.0
C	0.0	0.0	0.0	0.0
G	-1.1	0.0	-0.7	0.0
1	0.0	0.0	0.0	-1.2


#		5' --> 3'
		   GX
		   CY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	1    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.0	0.0	0.0	0.0
C	0.0	0.0	0.0	0.0
G	-1.2	0.0	-0.7	0.0
1	0.0	0.0	0.0	-1.2




#		5' --> 3'
		   GX
		   1Y
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	1    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.2	0.2	0.2	0.2
C	0.2	0.2	0.2	0.2
G	-0.9	0.2	-0.5	0.2
1	0.2	0.2	0.2	-1.0





#		5' --> 3'
		   1X
		   AY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	1    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.9	0.9	0.4	0.9
C	0.9	0.9	0.9	0.9
G	-0.2	0.9	0.2	0.9
1	0.9	0.9	0.9	-0.3






#		5' --> 3'
		   1X
		   GY
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	---------------------------- 
	A	C	G	1    
# 	----------------------------  
A	0.2	0.2	-0.3	0.2
C	0.2	0.2	0.2	0.2
G	-0.9	0.2	-0.5	0.2
1	0.2	0.2	0.2	-1.0

